{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2022-04-20 10:00:00', 'title': 'CIGNA CORPORATION ANNOUNCES APPEARANCE AT THE BOFA SECURITIES 2022 HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'BLOOMFIELD, CONN. , APRIL 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLOBAL HEALTH SERVICES COMPANY CIGNA CORPORATION (NYSE:CI) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT BRIAN EVANKO, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PRESENT AT THE BOFA SECURITIES 2022 HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE ON MAY 11, 2022 IN LAS VEGAS, NV.'}